  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Shadow Killer — Innate Technique (6th level)</em></p><p>At 6th level, you have learned to become one with the shadows, gaining darkvision out to 200 ft and can see through magical darkness within this range. You can spend 2 CE to cast <em>Pass Without Trace</em>. When you take the Hide action in dim light or darkness, you become invisible until you attack, use a technique, or enter an area of bright light.</p>",
